1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:07,978
An AI agent can choose what to buy, but it
should never decide how much authority it has.

2
00:00:07,978 --> 00:00:11,892
PACT is the permission layer between
AI intent and money movement.

3
00:00:12,112 --> 00:00:14,217
An unrestricted payment credential

4
00:00:14,217 --> 00:00:18,055
turns a model mistake or prompt
injection into financial loss.

5
00:00:18,055 --> 00:00:21,522
A confirmation dialog is not
a boundary; it is UI state.

6
00:00:21,522 --> 00:00:24,184
PACT decides whether a proposal is allowed.

7
00:00:24,404 --> 00:00:26,353
PACT separates four decisions:

8
00:00:26,353 --> 00:00:29,731
AI proposes, PACT verifies
against a signed mandate,

9
00:00:29,731 --> 00:00:33,239
the owner authorizes exceptions,
and PayPal processes.

10
00:00:33,239 --> 00:00:35,708
The agent never gets a payment secret.

11
00:00:35,928 --> 00:00:38,471
This is a real Postgres-backed account.

12
00:00:38,471 --> 00:00:43,427
Mandates, blocked evaluations and signed
audit events are persisted records.

13
00:00:43,427 --> 00:00:46,752
PayPal is not configured,
so no payment is claimed.

14
00:00:46,972 --> 00:00:49,048
Authority is a signed instrument.

15
00:00:49,048 --> 00:00:52,068
This mandate fixes a two-hundred-dollar ceiling,

16
00:00:52,068 --> 00:00:55,277
fifty dollars per transaction,
four authorizations,

17
00:00:55,277 --> 00:00:57,857
an expiry, one merchant and one category.

18
00:00:57,857 --> 00:01:00,562
PACT rebuilds the payload at decision time.

19
00:01:00,562 --> 00:01:03,268
Change a signed field and the proof breaks.

20
00:01:03,488 --> 00:01:08,735
The agent has its own Ed25519 identity,
so every proposal is attributable.

21
00:01:08,735 --> 00:01:11,004
Only the public half is exposed.

22
00:01:11,004 --> 00:01:15,968
It can propose, but cannot approve
itself or reach PayPal credentials.

23
00:01:16,188 --> 00:01:21,396
The agent selects from the server-controlled
catalog and creates a signed proposal.

24
00:01:21,396 --> 00:01:24,658
PACT re-checks signature,
ownership, status, expiry,

25
00:01:24,658 --> 00:01:28,737
merchant, category, amount, budget,
count, replay and delegation.

26
00:01:28,737 --> 00:01:32,815
The proposal is authorized and
the budget is reserved atomically.

27
00:01:32,815 --> 00:01:34,572
This is still not a payment.

28
00:01:34,792 --> 00:01:36,163
Here is the boundary.

29
00:01:36,163 --> 00:01:40,146
PACT authorized thirty-eight
dollars and reserved it locally.

30
00:01:40,146 --> 00:01:44,848
PayPal approval has not started, no
order exists, and no capture exists.

31
00:01:45,068 --> 00:01:47,356
Each scenario ran against the real engine

32
00:01:47,356 --> 00:01:50,536
with a signed harness mandate
and a manipulated proposal.

33
00:01:50,536 --> 00:01:54,442
Prompt injection is treated as text,
merchant substitution is blocked,

34
00:01:54,442 --> 00:01:58,460
replay is rejected, and concurrent
spending is serialized by a row lock.

35
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:01,839
This is a rejected proposal, not a settlement.

36
00:02:01,839 --> 00:02:04,860
Forty dollars exceeded the remaining budget.

37
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:09,255
Sixteen checks passed, one failed,
and PayPal was never reached.

38
00:02:09,255 --> 00:02:11,040
No transaction is created.

39
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:12,787
Delegation is attenuated.

40
00:02:12,787 --> 00:02:17,307
The child receives only a subset of
the parent's budget, scope and expiry.

41
00:02:17,307 --> 00:02:18,956
When the parent is revoked,

42
00:02:18,956 --> 00:02:22,804
the child is withdrawn even though
its signature remains valid.

43
00:02:23,024 --> 00:02:26,827
Every sensitive action appends
a hash-chained, signed record.

44
00:02:26,827 --> 00:02:32,190
The page recomputes the chain: one hundred
percent integrity, zero signature failures.

45
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:35,432
This is application evidence,
not immutable storage.

46
00:02:35,652 --> 00:02:38,353
No PayPal Sandbox credentials exist here.

47
00:02:38,353 --> 00:02:41,713
PACT fails closed and will
not fabricate a payment.

48
00:02:41,713 --> 00:02:47,050
The loopback contract test proves the
adapter, not a genuine Sandbox transaction.

49
00:02:47,050 --> 00:02:49,356
Live verification is still pending.

50
00:02:49,576 --> 00:02:51,905
AI proposes. PACT verifies.

51
00:02:51,905 --> 00:02:55,269
The owner authorizes. PayPal processes.

52
00:02:55,269 --> 00:03:01,480
Bounded, auditable permission to buy,
without giving the agent the keys.

